-# D6: values-lean on purpose — counts and times only, no task names or case content.
%p Hello #{@client_name},
%p
  This is a friendly reminder from #{@org_name}: you have
  = @task_count == 1 ? 'an appointment' : "#{@task_count} appointments"
  scheduled for tomorrow.
- if @timed_times.any?
  %p
    Scheduled #{@timed_times.size == 1 ? 'time' : 'times'}:
    = @timed_times.join(', ')
%p If you have questions or need to reschedule, please contact your case worker.
%p — #{@org_name}
